# the read of a field that two layouts keep at different offsets calls no stub and names no place of the program: the code finds the offset by the shape word and loads
# RUN: bytes f1:Body mechanisms=none+TypedOperations
# CHECK-LABEL: unit f1:Body
# CHECK-NOT: ReadAtSite
# CHECK-NOT: SiteCache
# CHECK-NOT: GetById
# two shapes at two distances: a table of a byte a shape takes one instruction fewer than a comparison
# RUN(TABLE): bytes f1:Body mechanisms=none+TypedOperations
# TABLE-LABEL: unit f1:Body
# TABLE: constant {{*}}OffsetTable
# RUN(WITHHELD): bytes f1:Body mechanisms=none
# WITHHELD-LABEL: unit f1:Body
# WITHHELD: argument thunk {{*}}GetById
# PROGRAM-OF: ../walk/typed-operations/offset-found-by-the-shape.ir
